#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A table of the language features included in OpenQASM 3."
msgstr "OpenQASM 3 に含まれる言語機能のテーブルです。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenQASM 3 feature table"
msgstr "OpenQASM 3 機能テーブル"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore negctrl, durationof, vstring */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore negctrl, durationof, vstring */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenQASM 3 feature table {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"
msgstr "OpenQASM 3 機能テーブル {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below is a list of the `OpenQASM 3` language features.\n"
msgstr "以下は `OpenQASM 3` の言語機能のリストです。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more details on these capabilities, see the [OpenQASM 3.X Live Specification](https://openqasm.com/).\n"
msgstr "これらの機能の詳細については、[OpenQASM 3.X Live Specification](https://openqasm.com/) を参照してください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key:\n"
msgstr "キー:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "❌ Not supported\n"
msgstr "❌ サポートなし\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "🟡 Partial support\n"
msgstr "🟡 部分的サポート\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "✅ Supported\n"
msgstr "✅ サポート済み\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of the complete \"supported\" mark depends on the column:\n"
msgstr "「サポート済み」マークの意味は列によって異なります:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: The feature can be parsed by [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (by using the `qiskit-qasm3-import` extension), represented in a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),\n"
"and exported to OpenQASM 3 by [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps).\n"
msgstr ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: この機能は [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3)（`qiskit-qasm3-import` 拡張機能を使用）でパースでき、[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) で表現でき、\n"
"[`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps) で OpenQASM 3 にエクスポートできます。\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*IBM Quantum Compute Service*: A circuit containing the corresponding Qiskit feature can be successfully executed on hardware through IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "*IBM Quantum Compute Service*：対応する Qiskit 機能を含む Circuit を、IBM Quantum Compute Service を通じてハードウェア上で正常に実行できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of \"partial support\" typically depends on the linked notes.\n"
msgstr "「部分的サポート」の意味は、通常、リンクされた注釈に依存します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Qiskit Runtime is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
#| "Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Quantum Compute Service is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"IBM Qiskit Runtime に Circuit を送信する最も一般的な方法は、Qiskit SDK の Python インターフェースで Circuit を作成することです。\n"
"この方法で作成・送信された Circuit は、OpenQASM 3 ファイルから Qiskit SDK に読み込む必要はありません。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not use OpenQASM 3 directly yourself, you can safely use features that are supported for representation in Qiskit SDK, export to OpenQASM 3, and submission to IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
"This includes features that cannot be loaded by Qiskit SDK from OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"OpenQASM 3 を直接使用しない場合は、Qiskit SDK での表現、OpenQASM 3 へのエクスポート、IBM Quantum Compute Service への送信がサポートされている機能を安全に使用できます。\n"
"これには、Qiskit SDK が OpenQASM 3 から読み込めない機能も含まれます。\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

